{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Desktop Companion</i></strong> is a customizable desktop assistant that lets you bring life to your screen. Import your own <strong>2D</strong> or <strong>3D</strong> models and turn them into interactive companions that live right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/b2d317aa05525ee7b3f0ff3a87c15705.poster.avif?t=1762717697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/b2d317aa05525ee7b3f0ff3a87c15705.webm?t=1762717697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/b2d317aa05525ee7b3f0ff3a87c15705.mp4?t=1762717697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Models \u2013 Add your own 2D gifs or full 3D characters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Interactions \u2013 Drag, throw, and play with your companion directly on your screen. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations \u2013 Add life with custom animations. Animate idle states, movements, or reactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity &amp; Physics \u2013 Enable gravity for fun and realistic motion. Let your model bounce around or fall naturally based on your desktop layout.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop - You can download others companions and share yours all within the Workshop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/2ceae1224b8c8a4a0fb92bf648f1d755.poster.avif?t=1762717697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/2ceae1224b8c8a4a0fb92bf648f1d755.webm?t=1762717697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/2ceae1224b8c8a4a0fb92bf648f1d755.mp4?t=1762717697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: The 2D and 3D models shown in the screenshots and trailer are for demonstration purposes only. They are not included in the application and serve only to showcase functionality.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920410/2192930ba5b2384b81ad3aea93e63850edcac671.jpg"},{"name":"Growing Company","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920410/27129bf70bb56b0b49fa849e4ecde17b29ce8c5c.jpg"},{"name":"Companion Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920410/bc08ab6e1864444bc26d444954e34ced9fbef919.jpg"},{"name":"A Hundred Companions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920410/f10fe8b63957aff20898f38e7c058637cad6dbc1.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920410/958417cb88f011dfbb457fdced7fd6c4f9878350.jpg"},{"name":"Crowd Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920410/e6b2498bf00c39e71d17d1619d2a5e090c430f26.jpg"},{"name":"Desktop Invasion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920410/505838ea0cc7d0eb805c276a33a0dc4aa6959955.jpg"},{"name":"Best of Both Worlds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im